━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Patch 1: pat┃Patch 2: pat
    ch1     ┃    ch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons
use only the source lines
quoted in the patches.

═════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES  *
═════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by
only that patch. A
sign-less line with one
number is an edit both
patches make: a new
number means both add it,
an old number means both
remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│foo┃ old new│foo
        │.c ┃        │.c
        │@@ ┃        │@@
   1   1│A  ┃   1   1│A
   2   2│B  ┃-  2    │bad
        │   ┃+      2│new
   3   3│C  ┃   3   3│C
-  4    │D  ┃   4   4│D
        │   ┃\       │No
        │   ┃        │new
        │   ┃        │lin
        │   ┃        │e a
        │   ┃        │t e
        │   ┃        │nd
        │   ┃        │of
        │   ┃        │fil
        │   ┃        │e
+      4│X  ┃        │

═════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES*
═════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present
in only one result: -
patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│foo┃     new│foo
        │.c ┃        │.c
        │@@ ┃        │@@
       1│A  ┃       1│A
-      2│B  ┃+      2│new
       3│C  ┃       3│C
